00:04:26.773 --> 00:04:32.205
Gwen Shotwell is moving more than 2 million SpaceX shares into children's accounts starting

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:32.845
in December.

00:04:33.545 --> 00:04:39.465
Tesla Roddy reported the block belongs to her and her husband Robert, and at $146 a share,

00:04:39.705 --> 00:04:42.285
the gift is valued at roughly $290 million.

00:04:43.145 --> 00:04:46.365
Elon Musk replied to the post with cool and a heart emoji.

00:04:47.045 --> 00:04:52.725
The first round targets children aged 11-17 in zip codes where median family income sits

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.965
at or below $57,000.

00:04:54.965 --> 00:05:00.965
A second round will include military families overseas, children in foster care, and additional

00:05:00.965 --> 00:05:04.365
Texas counties with median income up to $90,000.

00:05:04.745 --> 00:05:11.917
At the earlier $135 IPO price, the same block would have been worth about $270 million.

00:05:13.097 --> 00:05:18.517
Musk's separate pledge of one SpaceX share to each of America's 72 million children would

00:05:18.517 --> 00:05:23.137
total around $10.5 billion at the same $146 mark.

00:05:23.137 --> 00:05:28.877
The program's design requires treasury and IRS coordination to move shares into accounts

00:05:28.877 --> 00:05:32.377
that otherwise default to an S&amp;P 500 index fund.

00:05:33.077 --> 00:05:38.717
Shotwell's team worked with the Dell Foundation, Greater Horizons, Invest America, and two law

00:05:38.717 --> 00:05:41.537
firms over several months to complete the escrow transfer.

00:05:42.077 --> 00:05:47.977
That timeline suggests the $10.5 billion Musk pledge will need similar infrastructure scaled

00:05:47.977 --> 00:05:50.037
across every state and military base.

00:05:50.037 --> 00:05:57.057
A $11 drop in the SpaceX share price trims the shot-well gift by roughly $22 million and

00:05:57.057 --> 00:05:59.277
the Musk Pledge by more than $800 million.

00:06:00.157 --> 00:06:05.417
Recipients in lower-income zip codes receive the shares without any cash outlay, yet they

00:06:05.417 --> 00:06:09.257
inherit the same liquidity limits that apply to early SpaceX investors.

00:06:09.757 --> 00:06:16.117
The $290 million transfer equals roughly 1-6 of her reported $12.6 million share stake.

00:06:16.117 --> 00:06:21.777
The GIFs function as distributed ownership that does not dilute existing shareholders, while

00:06:21.777 --> 00:06:24.617
still moving economic exposure to a new generation.

00:06:25.237 --> 00:06:31.037
The operational detail, escrow setup, income thresholds, and multi-round eligibility is

00:06:31.037 --> 00:06:34.297
what determines whether broader capital access actually happens.

